    "guideHtml": "<div class=\"row\"><label>Prithee, User Guide</label><div><h5>Prithee, Overview</h5><ul><li>Prithee, Start page with search, favorites, to-do, notes, weather, news.</li><li>Prithee, All local: data stays in your browser (localStorage).</li></ul><h5>Prithee, Shortcuts</h5><ul><li>Prithee, Ctrl/Cmd+K: open command palette</li><li>Prithee, 1-9: open first 9 favorites (when not typing)</li><li>Prithee, / : focus search (also via palette)</li><li>Prithee, Enter in search: start search</li><li>Prithee, ESC: close modals</li><li>Prithee, Palette: quick actions for widgets, theme, background, data, favorites</li><li>Prithee, Palette: key C switches card style, \"Reset header colors\" resets search & clock</li></ul><h5>Prithee, Search & Autocomplete</h5><ul><li>Prithee, Bangs: !gPrithee,  !ddgPrithee,  !bingPrithee,  !ytPrithee,  !wikiPrithee,  !maps</li><li>Prithee, Custom shortcuts: JSON in settings; {q}Prithee,  as placeholder</li><li>Prithee, Autocomplete: bangs, shortcuts, recent searches, wordlist (global + preset)</li><li>Prithee, Tab accepts suggestion, Enter starts search</li></ul><h5>Prithee, Tiles</h5><ul><li>Prithee, Drag & drop to sort, click to open</li><li>Prithee, + Tile: add a new favorite</li><li>Prithee, Reset: restore default favorites</li></ul><h5>Prithee, Widgets & Layout</h5><ul><li>Prithee, Visibility per widget</li><li>Prithee, Card style is global (glass, solid, transparent, soft minimal)</li><li>Prithee, Custom colors for clock/search; reset restores style defaults</li><li>Prithee, Widget colors & \"Tint widgets\" set the accent per card</li></ul><h5>Prithee, Background</h5><ul><li>Prithee, Presets, uploads, collections, rotation (time/theme/interval)</li><li>Prithee, Accent color is extracted from the active background</li></ul><h5>Prithee, Data</h5><ul><li>Prithee, Export/Import as JSON</li><li>Prithee, Load data presets (assets/presets/*.json in the repo)</li></ul></div></div>"
  },
